"Sheya dis kɔd wit yu kɔntakt we yu kin trɔst. Dɛn fɔ ad am to wan ɔtɛntiketɔ app lɛk Gnome Authenticator.\n"
"\n"
"If yu de put am manuali, mek shɔ se di sɛtin dɛn dɔŋ ya de:\n"
"• Aligoritɛm: SHA1\n"
"• Diji dɛn: 6\n"
"• Intaval: 60 sɛkɔnd\n"
"\n"
"Wan wan akshɔn gɛt in yon kɔd. We dɛn de trig wan akshɔn bay SMS, dɛn mɔs put di kɔrɛnt 6-diji kɔd kɔmɔt na dɛn ɔtɛntiketɔ afta di kiwɔd."

